cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "rl-triton: High-Performance Triton GPU Kernels for Reinforcement Learning Credit Assignment"
abstract: >-
  Fused Triton GPU kernels for reinforcement-learning credit assignment: GAE,
  V-Trace, Retrace(lambda), TD(lambda) returns, discounted returns, eligibility
  traces, and episodic prefix sums, each expressed as the same first-order
  affine associative scan and evaluated on-chip.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Lars Simon"
    family-names: "Zehnder"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.3
date-released: "2026-08-17"
repository-code: "https://github.com/simonsays1980/rl-triton"
url: "https://simonsays1980.github.io/rl-triton"
keywords:
  - reinforcement learning
  - triton
  - gpu
  - cuda
  - kernels
  - gae
  - vtrace
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21984504"

